{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to distant worlds, where every puzzle is a gateway to the unknown.\u00a0 Lose yourself in the meditative rhythm of matching tiles, unlocking new experiences as you explore the realms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Mystical and Alien Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through beautifully crafted realms, each with its own unusual tile sets and atmospheric themes. From tranquil zen spaces to eerie alien worlds, every realm offers a distinct experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own puzzles with the intuitive editor and share them on the Steam Workshop. Browse a growing collection of player-made layouts for endless replayability and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Music &amp; Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm is brought to life with custom music tracks and striking visuals, creating a deep, immersive atmosphere that evolves with your journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3284780?t=1764905839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/210f2544f44a1410ad6d172ed1b71d5b516b8eef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764905839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/9eff27bea3139144e4e7ec028c7c6f6a31de1098/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764905839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/9eff27bea3139144e4e7ec028c7c6f6a31de1098/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764905839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3540010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to distant worlds, where every puzzle is a gateway to the unknown.\u00a0 Lose yourself in the meditative rhythm of matching tiles, unlocking new experiences as you explore the realms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Mystical and Alien Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through beautifully crafted realms, each with its own unusual tile sets and atmospheric themes. From tranquil zen spaces to eerie alien worlds, every realm offers a distinct experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own puzzles with the intuitive editor and share them on the Steam Workshop. Browse a growing collection of player-made layouts for endless replayability and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Music &amp; Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm is brought to life with custom music tracks and striking visuals, creating a deep, immersive atmosphere that evolves with your journey.</p>","developers":["Realm Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284780/f51a3779d9865fb5d71996690edbb47418e29364/header.jpg?t=1764905839","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3284780/1191717644/1d431086b3d484e1284e29d6c96f0f034ddfc07a/1764125453/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764126136","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3284780/1191717644/1d431086b3d484e12